{"id":69,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"Prefers hot and humid places. It ensnares tiny bugs with its vines and devours them."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Bellsprout’s thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack, however strong it may be. From its mouth, this Pokémon spits a corrosive fluid that melts even iron."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"Its bud looks like a human face. Because of the bud, it is rumored to be a type of legendary mandrake plant."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Even though its body is extremely skinny, it is blindingly fast when catching its prey."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It prefers hot and humid environments. It is quick at capturing prey with its vines."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It plants its feet deep underground to replenish water. It can’t escape its enemy while it’s rooted."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"A carnivorous POKéMON that traps and eats bugs. It appears to use its root feet to replenish moisture."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A BELLSPROUT’s thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack, however strong it may be. From its mouth, it leaks a fluid that melts even iron."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"If it notices anything that moves, it immediately flings its vine at the object."},{"games":["Yellow"],"text":"Prefers hot and humid places. It ensnares tiny insects with its vines and devours them."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"A carnivorous POKéMON that traps and eats bugs. It uses its root feet to soak up needed moisture."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Gluttony","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon is holding a Berry to be eaten when its HP is low, it will instead eat the Berry when its HP drops to half or less."}],"eg